  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SN Power Middle Yeywa Hydropower Feasibility study (phase III)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SN Power is applying for funds to do a full feasibility study (phase III) of Middle Yeywa hydropower project in Myanmar, as a follow up of previous pre-feasibility study (phase I) and Environmental and Social Impact Assessment (ESIA) (phase II) with Norad support. The amount applied is NOK 59 454 000, approx. 50% of total estimated project development cost of USD 14 million, in 2017, 2018 and 2019, until Financial Close and investment decision.</narrative>
  </description>
